model halina
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2024-01-01
  end 2024-12-31
  note "PTY-05, household D (Halina): the gift derived from her own records, a planned movement to Ania, whom D doesn't keep (an outside place)."

source d_household "Household D's records: given 5 000.00 to Ania (made up)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place acc_halina: accounts DUK lives 2024-01-01..

place ania: outside lives 2024-01-01..

input gift_amount: money DUK

input gift_day: date

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from acc_halina to ania amount gift_amount

ask q_halina: flows(acc_halina, 2024)

version d_records
  cite d_household
  governs always
  known 2024-01-01
  gift_amount = 5000.00 "D-G1: given to Ania"
  gift_day = 2024-05-02 "D-G1"
